      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements\n- Support notifications via Email, SMS and Push\n- Retrying of failed deliveries\n- System should not block while sending notifications (Asynchronous)\n- Support Single notifications per request\n- Notification may contain a subject(optional) and a message body(mandatory)\n\nCore Entities\n- Recipient\n- NotificationType\n- Notification\n- NotificationService",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements\n- Support notifications via Email, SMS and Push\n- Retrying of failed deliveries\n- System should not block while sending notifications (Asynchronous)\n- Support Single notifications per request\n- Notification may contain a subject(optional) and a message body(mandatory)\n\nCore Entities\n- Recipient\n- NotificationType\n- Notification\n- NotificationService",
